The files in js/ are esm.sh builds of micromark 3.2.0 and
micromark-extension-gfm 3.0.0, with the packages they depend on. Both are
under the MIT License below.

The -umd.js files wrap those builds as UMD scripts so Lightning Web Security
can load them. They set window.plutoMarkdown and window.plutoMarkdownGfm.
The wrapping is by Sonal for Pluto (2026) and is also under the MIT License.

